 drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig        | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/cpufreq/Makefile       |  7 ++++++-
 drivers/cpufreq/cpufreq.c      |  1 +
 drivers/cpufreq/freq_table.c   |  6 ------
 drivers/cpufreq/scpi-cpufreq.c |  4 +++-
